High — `src/planner/minds/sessions/service.py:529`: invalid `prompt.submit` dispositions call `_detach_image_paths`, but `_detach_image_paths` aborts on the first `GatewayError` at `src/planner/minds/sessions/service.py:550`, so later attached images are never detached. This violates the contract requirement to detach every attached image for rejected/invalid prompt attempts even if one detach fails, before another prompt may enter. Smallest fix/test: make the invalid-disposition cleanup best-effort or collect detach errors while attempting all paths, then raise the original invalid-disposition error; add a regression with two attached images, invalid submit status, first detach failing, and assert both `image.detach` calls occur before the next `prompt.submit`.

Medium — `web/src/components/ChatComposer.svelte:206`: paste pre-filters clipboard files to images before calling `intakeFiles`, while picker/drop pass their file lists through the shared intake/validation path. Mixed or non-image clipboard files therefore bypass the same rejection/error behavior, violating the approved “picker/drop/paste use one intake” contract. Smallest fix/test: route clipboard file lists through the same intake path after deciding the paste contains files, and add a real `ClipboardEvent` test for mixed image plus non-image clipboard files.
